        "2310.13102_rag::chunk_003"^^xsd:string ;
    :hasEvidenceText "Classifier guidance leverages an extra classifier network to compute a gradient as the modification on the d"^^xsd:string,
        "Dhariwal and Nichol ( 2021 ) propose classifier guidance where the class conditional parameters ( x t | y ) and ( x t | y ) are perturbed by the gradients of a classifier p ( y | x t ) that predicts the target class y ."^^xsd:string,
        "Similarly to how classifier guidance is applied, we modify the reverse diffusion process by adding the gradient of a potential."^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :entity,
        owl:Thing ;
    skos:skos_definition "A mechanism that leverages an extra classifier network to compute a gradient to constrain denoising networks to satisfy conditions."^^xsd:string ;
