        "the DDIM-Solver is actually the first-order discretization approximation of the DPM-Solver"^^xsd:string,
        "we compare four sampling methods, namely DDIM, DDPM, S-PNDM and F-PNDM"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :diffusion_ode_solver,
        :samplingmethod,
        owl:Thing ;
