    kg:textSpan "the task: computer vision, natural language processing, temporal data modeling, multi-modal learning, robust learning, and interdisciplinary applications. For each category, we provide a brief introduction to the task, followed by a detailed explanation of how diffusion models have been applied to improve performance. Table 3 summarizes the various applications that have made use of diffusion models. [/TABLE] to explore the upper limit of the performance of the generative model, while conditiona" .

