    kg:textSpan "Additionally, we list the data sets on which the surveyed models are applied. We use the following abbreviations in the architecture column: D3PM (Discrete Denoising Diffusion Probabilistic Models), DSB (Diffusion Schrodinger Bridge), BDDM (Bilateral Denoising Diffusion Models), PNDM (Pseudo Numerical Methods for Diffusion Models), ADM (Ablated Diffusion Model), D2C (Diffusion-Decoding Models with Contrastive Representations), CCDF (Come-Closer-Diffuse-Faster), VQ-DDM (Vector Quantised Discrete " .

