    kg:textSpan "equivalent to a noise prediction task. Formally, a noise prediction network ( x t , t ) is adopted to learn E [ | x t ] by minimizing a noise prediction objective, i.e., min E t, x 0 , ( x t , t ) 2 2 , where t is uniform between 1 and T . To learn conditional diffusion models, e.g., class-conditional [ 13 ] or textto-image [ 52 ] models, the condition information is further fed into the noise prediction objective: min E t, x 0 ,c, ( x t , t, c ) 2 2 , (1) where c is the condition or its continu" .

