    kg:textSpan "process through label-dropping. In addition, both methods are limited by their need for hard-earned external conditions, which binds them to conditional settings. In light of the limitations mentioned above, in this work, we present a more general formulation of diffusion guidance that can make use of information within the intermediate samples of diffusion models. This formulation detaches the necessary condition of traditional approaches [ 16 , 7 , 23 ], i.e ., the requirement for external inf" .

