    kg:textSpan "40 ], fast SDE integrators [ 8 ] have been proposed to improve the sampling speed of diffusion models. Other works develop higher-order solvers [ 17 ], exponential integrators [ 15 ], and dynamic programming based approach [ 43 ] to accelerating sampling speed. However, none of these approaches have achieved comparable performance as our method on distilling classifier-free guided diffusion models. Existing distillation-based methods for diffusion models are mainly designed for non-classifier-fr" .

