    kg:textSpan "], [ 2 ], [ 8 ], excel at synthesizing photo-realistic images, enabling many image synthesis and editing applications. For example, users can edit an image by drawing sketches [ 9 ], [ 10 ], semantic maps [ 4 ], [ 9 ], or strokes [ 11 ]. All of these applications require users to interact with generative models frequently and therefore demand short inference time. M. Li, J. Lin and S. Han are with Massachusetts Institute of Technology. C. Meng and S. Ermon are with Stanford University. J.-Y. Zhu" .

