    kg:textSpan "]. Another possible solution explores the idea of diffusing in a lower dimensional space , and then scaling it up, with a cascade structure [ 17 ] or in the latent space [ 43 , 57 ]. In distinction from them, we build an efcient diffusion model using light-weight architecture and knowledge distillation. Frequency Analysis for Generative Model. Neural networks tend to t low-frequency signals rst and shift to the high-frequency components, which is referred to as frequency principle of deep neural" .

