    kg:textSpan "10 , 5 ] show that one can learn predictive representations without labels, which serve as an ideal tool for obtaining meaningful conditions. Specically, we simply run a clustering algorithm (e.g., k -means) Preprint. Under review. on the features extracted by a model pre-trained in a self-supervised manner (on the same dataset) and use the cluster indices as conditions to train a conditional model. Although our analyses and the self-conditional approach is applicable to all types of deep genera" .

