    kg:textSpan "the brain processes sensory input in the VC to extract relevant features from images for object recognition, employing a hierarchical approach similar to convolutional neural networks (CNNs). We propose a linear mapping between processed fMRI data and the last convolutional layer of the ResNet50 [13] architecture, trained on the ImageNet dataset. The objective is to nd the optimal weights W that minimize the regularized loss described in Eq. (1): Semantic visual reconstruction from brain 7 Here," .

