    kg:textSpan "evaluation to assess the semantic similarity of the reconstructed images. 3.7 Human Evaluation of Image Reconstructions We designed a human evaluation paradigm as follows. A local web page was created, which displayed the original image alongside ve model-generated reconstructions in one row and ve random reconstructions in another row (Fig. Semantic visual reconstruction from brain 9 2). Volunteers were instructed to examine the similarities between the images and select the row (rst or second)" .

