    kg:textSpan "Fig. D.5 . For image generation, we mainly use the ImageNet dataset ( Russakovsky et al. , 2015 ). For data augmentation, we only use center crops and random left-right flipping. We also use CIFAR-10 ( Krizhevsky et al. ) to show the model can be trained with small datasets. For evaluation, we follow common practice, using FID ( Heusel et al. , 2017 ) and Inception Score ( Salimans et al. , 2016 ) as metrics computed on 50K samples, generated with 1000 steps of DDPM. For video prediction, we use" .

