    kg:textSpan "al. , 2015 ), but scale better by leveraging piecewise optimization enabled by diffusion models. Diffusion Models. Common diffusion models for images and videos can be roughly divided into pixel diffusion models ( Sohl-Dickstein et al. , 2015 ; Ho et al. , 2020 ; Song et al. , 2020 ; Dhariwal & Nichol , 2022 ; Ho et al. , 2022a ; Karras et al. , 2022 ) and latent diffusion models ( Rombach et al. , 2022 ). In this work we focus on pixel diffusion models due to their relative simplicity. It is kn" .

