    kg:textSpan "more efcient. One example is the work of Song et al. [10] (DDIM), in which they dene a new family of non-Markovian diffusion processes that maintains the same training objectives as a traditional DDPM. They demonstrate that alternative ELBOs may be built using only a sub-sequence of the original timesteps { 1 , ..., T } , obtaining faster samplers compatible with a pre-trained DDPM. Other works focus on using the Score SDE formulation [11] of continuoustime DDMs to develop faster sampling method" .

