    kg:textSpan "is used, we set t = 0 . As feature extractors, we use the standard Inception-V3 1 pretrained on Image-Net, and the ViT-B/32 2 model from CLIP [21]. We use torch-delity [49] for the FID evaluation. We train all the models for about 500 iterations. Finetuning with a budget of 5 timesteps required about 10 minutes for CIFAR-10, about 45 minutes for CelebA, and about one hour for ImageNet on a single Nvidia RTX A6000. For LSUN-Church and for the other timesteps budgets, netuning has been performed o" .

