    kg:textSpan "Models: DDGMs with classiers Taking into account the observations described in Section 4, we propose to train a joint model that is composed of a classier and a DDGM. We propose to use a shared parameterization, namely, a shared encoder of the UNet architecture that serves as the generative part and for calculating pooled features for the classier. We pool the latent representations of the data from dierent levels of the UNet architecture into one vector z . On top of this vector, we build a cla" .

