    kg:textSpan "S TABLE TARGET FIELD FOR REDUCED VARIANCE SCORE ESTIMATION IN DIFFUSION MODELS Yilun Xu , Shangyuan Tong , Tommi Jaakkola Computer Science and Articial Intelligence Lab, Massachusetts Institute of Technology ylxu@mit.edu ; { sytong, tommi } @csail.mit.edu A BSTRACT arXiv:2302.00670v2 [cs.LG] 17 Feb 2023 Diffusion models generate samples by reversing a xed forward diffusion process. Despite already providing impressive empirical results, these diffusion models algorithms can be further improved b" .

