    kg:textSpan "average trace-of-covariance of the training targets by at least n 1 times in the far eld. Together, we demonstrate that the STF targets have diminishing bias (Theorem 1 ) and are much more stable during training (Theorem 2 ). These properties make the STF objective more favorable for diffusion models training with stochastic gradient optimization. 6 E XPERIMENTS In this section, we rst empirically validate our theoretical analysis in Section 5 , especially for variance reduction in the intermedi" .

