    kg:textSpan "39 ] and generate images with better sample quality than GANs. DMs have been applied to conditional generation tasks like text-toimage generation [ 28 , 34 ], image inpainting [ 33 ], and superresolution [ 35 ]. However, few works studied how to extend DMs for layout-to-image generation. Rombach et al. [ 31 ] proposed the pioneering Latent Diffusion Model (LDM), which applies DM in the latent space of a Vector-Quantized Variational Auto-Encoder (VQ-VAE) [ 43 ]. This work tokenized the layout to " .

