    kg:textSpan "more difcult. Compare to LDM, LayoutDiffuse achieves better performance with much less training epochs. Fig. 5 demonstrates that LayoutDiffuse can produce better quality images that t well with conditioning masks with much less training efforts. 4.3. Implementation Details Our box-to-image model is initialized from the textto-image LDM pretrained on LAION-400M [ 37 ] by [ 31 ], which has a denoising U-Net/VQ-VAE/language model of 903M/83.7M/581M parameters. The mask-to-image model is initialized" .

