    kg:textSpan "LDM. By inserting layout attention as a residual network, LayoutDiffuse is able to generate images from a good initial point, and the only objective the model learns is adding the condition to the image. Padding the conditioning mask to the input along the image channel, however, can hardly leverage the foundational model. The ne-tuned LDM takes 200 epochs to achieve similar performance on mIoU and cannot produce the same quality image regarding the FID score. We think this is because the input " .

