    kg:docId "2302.10167_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2302_10167_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "detectors or additional labels. Image editing with diffusion models. The use of diffusion models [ 20 ; 45 ] to modify images is a topic of considerable research. These models have been employed for image inpainting [ 33 ; 43 ; 45 ], scribble-based modifications [ 6 ; 34 ] or in-domain compositing operations [ 34 ]. More recently, text-based diffusion models [ 36 ; 39 ; 41 ] have been leveraged for editing operations guided by natural language. These include text or reference-based inpainting [ " .

