    kg:textSpan "Denoising Diffusion Probabilistic Models (DDPM) 1 , for the first time showing that diffusion models can achieve performance comparable to other state-of-art generative models in image generation tasks. Following the work, Dhariwal and Nichol 10 further improved the diffusion network structure and the training strategy to boost the performance. The improved diffusion models surpassed GANs in image synthesis. Since then, diffusion models have emerged as the first choice for many generative tasks " .

