    kg:textSpan "resolution of 256 256 . All experimental configurations, including the number of steps, variance schedule (denoted by eta in the following), and classifier-free guidance scale, follow the official implementation [ 49 ]. For low-bit quantization, we use the PTQ method proposed in BRECQ [ 35 ] and AdaRound [ 44 ], which is congruent with Q-Diffusion [ 34 ]. For 8 -bit quantization on ImageNet, we only use a naive PTQ method proposed by TensorRT [ 48 ], which is simple and fast. The input and outpu" .

