    kg:textSpan "efficiency and effectiveness of our proposed Diff-Pruning, we perform pruning experiments on two 256 256 scene datasets, LSUN Church, and LSUN Bedroom. The pre-trained models from [ 18 ] require around 2.4M and 4.4M training steps, which can be quite time-consuming in practice. We demonstrate that Diff-Pruning can compress these pre-existing models using only 10% of the standard training resources. We report the number of parameters, MACs, and FID scores in Table 2. We compare the pruned methods" .

