    kg:textSpan "different class, but the perturbation is not completely removed. Therefore, the poor robustness of diffusion-based purification is largely due to the vulnerability of downstream classifiers. On the other hand, although adversarial training methods using data generated by diffusion models achieve excellent performance, they are usually not generalizable across different threats ( Tramr & Boneh , 2019 ; Nie et al. , 2022 ). In summary, these methods leverage diffusion models to improve adversarial" .

