    kg:textSpan "Training Generators with Score-Based Diffusion: Score GANs We propose training a generator with the score-based diffusion flow of NCSN, Equation ( 9 ), left. This involves applying Equation ( 13 ) with h t = log p data k RBF log t , where t represents the training time of the generator. To do so, we directly use the generator weight update formula of Equation ( 11 ), as this avoids the problem of estimating h t and only requires its gradient h t = log p data k RBF log t . Composed of the scores " .

