    kg:textSpan "modeling complex data distribution and stabilizing training in comparison with previous GAN-based models [5,4951], which suffer from unstable training. [12] first proposed to utilize a neural network to estimate noise distribution. The backbone structure used in theirs and most other diffusion models is UNet [35]. More recently, a line of works [3,32] have also explored the application of Transformers [9] as a backbone network, with U-ViT [3] utilized the long skip connection and leveraged Adapt" .

