    kg:textSpan "D IFF E NC : V ARIATIONAL D IFFUSION WITH A L EARNED E NCODER Beatrix M. G. Nielsen, 1 Anders Christensen, 1,2 Andrea Dittadi, 2,4 Ole Winther 1,3,5 1 Technical University of Denmark, 2 Helmholtz AI, Munich, 3 University of Copenhagen, 4 Max Planck Institute for Intelligent Systems, 5 Copenhagen University Hospital A BSTRACT arXiv:2310.19789v2 [cs.LG] 8 Feb 2024 Diffusion models may be viewed as hierarchical variational autoencoders (VAEs) with two improvements: parameter sharing for the conditi" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2310_19789_rag__chunk_001> a kg:Chunk ;
