    kg:textSpan "OMPATIBILITY WITH O THER A CCELERATION Our method accelerates diffusion models by using different-sized models to process different steps. It is compatible with existing methods, making it a plug-and-play module that is easy to use. When combined with latent diffusion models (Rombach et al., 2022), we only need to train the slimmable network on the latent space. When combined with step-skipping methods (Song et al., 2020a; Liu et al., 2022; Lu et al., 2022a;b), we only need to reduce the evoluti" .

