        "Reverse Process. Leveraging the above definitions, we can approximate a reverse process to get a sample from q ( x 0 ) ."^^xsd:string,
        "The reverse denoise process is trained to reverse the forward diffusion process in Eq. 2 by learning the denoise network."^^xsd:string,
        "The reverse process is defined by learned Gaussian transitions and gradually denoises the data"^^xsd:string,
        "a reverse chain that removes the noise from the data to recover it to the original one."^^xsd:string,
        "compute approximate samples from the reverse process by running the approximate reverse process"^^xsd:string,
        "the errors of the approximate solutions from predicting every data state in the reverse process as one-step prediction errors."^^xsd:string,
        "the joint probability of the reverse process is given by"^^xsd:string,
