    kg:textSpan "that patch diffusion models could achieve better generation quality on typical small datasets. Finally, we evaluate the out-painting capability of patch diffusion models. Datasets. Following previous works [ 22 , 8 , 23 ], we select CelebA ( 200k images) [ 34 ], FFHQ (70k images) [ 20 ], LSUN ( 200k images) [ 63 ], and ImageNet ( 1.2 million images) [ 9 ] as our large datasets, and AFHQv2-Cat/Dog/Wild ( 5k images in each of them) [7] as our small datasets. Evaluation protocol. We measure image g" .

